    {
      "number": 1299,
      "text": "The hypocrites fear that a chapter should be sent down about them, informing [the believers] of what is in their hearts[57]. Say [O Prophet], “Keep on mocking! Allah will certainly expose what you fear.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 9,
        "name": "سُورَةُ التَّوۡبَةِ",
